  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing food security through cricket farming and bread production in Nigeria, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project develops and pilots an innovative food product: nutritious, affordable bread enriched with crickets, produced through a controlled, scalable supply chain in Nigeria. It addresses structural protein and micronutrient deficiencies, creates new income opportunities for smallholder farmers, and reduces reliance on costly imports of wheat and animal proteins.</narrative>
  </description>
